OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled and road warnings
OL,4,Aas Scotland prepares for Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain and ferry services have been
OL,7,Fcancelled and police have warned
OL,8,Fagainst unnecessary road journeys as
OL,9,FScotland prepares for the arrival of
OL,10,FStorm Boelo.
OL,12,FHeavy rain and strong winds are
OL,13,Fexpected during the second named storm
OL,14,Fto hit in two days, with gusts of up to
OL,15,F80mph forecast.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
