OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled and road warnings
OL,4,Aas Scotland prepares for Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost of the country is covered by a
OL,7,Fyellow Met Office warning from midday
OL,8,Fon Saturday, while a more severe amber
OL,9,Falert takes effect from 21:00 on
OL,10,FSaturday until 21:00 on Sunday,
OL,11,Fcovering the mainland and Western
OL,12,FIsles.
OL,14,FForecasters say the storm, which is the
OL,15,Fsecond named storm in two days, could
OL,16,Fresult in injury, flying debris, power
OL,17,Fcuts and damage to trees and buildings.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
